    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s an old rumor about an abandoned hospital where a ghostly figure dressed as a nurse roams the halls.<br>To uncover the truth behind the eerie tale, you and your friend decide to visit the hospital yourselves.<br>Before you realize it, you\u2019ve stepped into an otherworldly dimension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now trapped inside, you must run, hide, and outwit the terrifying <i>Nurse Baba</i> who relentlessly chases intruders.<br>Search the hospital to find hidden keys and unravel the story of what truly happened in this cursed place.<br>Only by understanding Baba\u2019s lingering regrets can you hope to escape.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Run &amp; Hide</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evade the terrifying Baba by running through the hospital corridors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hide in lockers or behind objects to survive when danger is near.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover notes, records, and clues scattered throughout the hospital.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use keys to unlock new areas and uncover the hidden past of the hospital.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Nurse Baba</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No matter where you go, she\u2019ll follow.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But if you observe her closely, you might learn about her past and the life she once lived.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Replayable</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even if you get caught, you can quickly restart from your last checkpoint.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Never give up\u2014the truth is waiting for those who persist.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiple Endings</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices and what you uncover determine the ending.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you discover the true ending and free both yourself and Baba?</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s an old rumor about an abandoned hospital where a ghostly figure dressed as a nurse roams the halls.<br>To uncover the truth behind the eerie tale, you and your friend decide to visit the hospital yourselves.<br>Before you realize it, you\u2019ve stepped into an otherworldly dimension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now trapped inside, you must run, hide, and outwit the terrifying <i>Nurse Baba</i> who relentlessly chases intruders.<br>Search the hospital to find hidden keys and unravel the story of what truly happened in this cursed place.<br>Only by understanding Baba\u2019s lingering regrets can you hope to escape.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Run &amp; Hide</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evade the terrifying Baba by running through the hospital corridors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hide in lockers or behind objects to survive when danger is near.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover notes, records, and clues scattered throughout the hospital.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use keys to unlock new areas and uncover the hidden past of the hospital.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Nurse Baba</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No matter where you go, she\u2019ll follow.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But if you observe her closely, you might learn about her past and the life she once lived.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Replayable</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even if you get caught, you can quickly restart from your last checkpoint.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Never give up\u2014the truth is waiting for those who persist.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiple Endings</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices and what you uncover determine the ending.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you discover the true ending and free both yourself and Baba?</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "A 2D adventure horror game where you are chased by an old lady. You get lost in a hospital. Can you escape without being caught by the old lady?",
